<title>USA: U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. sorghum weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA sorghum export sales highlights in latest report week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 171,300 MT were three and three-quarters times the prior week and three and one-half times the 4-week average. Japan (113,200 MT) and Mexico (58,400 MT) were the major buyers.</p>
<p>Exports of 104,400 MT fell 30 percent from the previous week and one-third from the 4-week average.  The destinations were Japan (66,100 MT), Israel (23,100 MT), and Mexico (15,200 MT).</p>
</text>
